# Bot1's Ornithopter attacks unblocked; in the declare blockers step Bot1 casts Shredder's Technique for {B} (one Mox Jet), returning the Ornithopter
# to hand, and destroys Bot2's Ornithopter. No combat damage is dealt, as the attacker left combat.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Shredder's Technique
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Hand.Shredder's Technique.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Sneak)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet
Bot1.Graveyard = Shredder's Technique
